1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,946
Dadi roz sham ko diya kyun jalati thi?

2
00:00:02,996 --> 00:00:07,322
Raat gehri thi, aur Pinku ko raasta dikhai nahi de raha tha.

3
00:00:07,372 --> 00:00:13,029
Dadi ne ek chhota diya jalaya, aur sab roshan ho gaya.

4
00:00:13,079 --> 00:00:16,761
Dadi boli: andhere mein ek chhota diya bhi sabka raasta dikha deta hai.

5
00:00:16,811 --> 00:00:19,775
Kal batati hoon, Pinku ne agla diya kahan rakha.
